        652.3809814453125
      ],
      "sha256": "b4345db5f027777e4476c6069ff9c128d82ef596f31fe98483d09055735648ce",
      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 7. Eight-participant questionnaire, counts ordered disagree, neutral, agree, strongly agree: A-FRAME easy to learn 2, 1, 4, 1; A-FRAME easy to use 1, 2, 4, 1; FlowMatic easy to learn 1, 1, 1, 5; FlowMatic easy to use 1, 1, 3, 3; good FlowMatic design 0, 0, 5, 3; helpful for VR programming 1, 1, 4, 2; easy to become skillful 1, 1, 3, 3; fun to play 1, 0, 1, 6. No strongly-disagree responses are plotted."
    },
    {
